 and thee. Speak thy mind! Thou art the sum of
 the sum of a big pig and a big big
 toad and thee. Speak thy mind! Thou art a big
 big big big big toast. Speak thy mind! Thou art
 thee. Art thou as good as a boat? Thou art
 the sum of thee and the sum of a creek
 and a big big big big big big coat. Speak
 thy mind! Thou art thee. Thou art the sum of
 thee and the sum of a big big big glove
 and the sum of a goat and a big wig.
 Speak thy mind! Speak thy mind! Thou art a big
 big big big big moat. Speak thy mind! Thou art
 the sum of thee and the sum of a dart
 and the sum of a big big big big big
 big note and the sum of a big big fig
 and a big big big vote. Speak thy mind! Art
 thou worse than thee? Art thou worse than a heart?
 Thou art the sum of thee and the sum of
 a big big big hose and a big big love.
 Speak thy mind! Art thou as good as a dove?
 Thou art the sum of thee and the sum of
 a big worm and a big big hog. Speak thy
 mind! Thou art thee. Art thou worse than a spy?
 Thou art the sum of the sum of a big
 big wolf and the sum of a big big big
 thief and a big pig and thee. Speak thy mind!
 Thou art the sum of the sum of a hind
 and the sum of a big nose and a big
 big rose and thee. Speak thy mind! Is a twig
 as good as thee? Art thou worse than a glove?
 Thou art the sum of thee and the sum of
 a big toad and a big big worm. Speak thy
 mind! Thou art the sum of a big big tie
 and the sum of a big big big big big
 hood and the sum of a big big big wig
